{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_36","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"jq -r '.references[]|[.citation_key,.title,.consulted_content,.evidence_path]|@tsv' references_provenance.json; rg -n 'def |family|coverage|revision|modal|normalize' source_evidence/capture.py | head -65; jq '.grounding_sources|to_entries[]|select(.key|test(\\\"attempt|failure|total_attempt|evaluated_program\\\"))|{key,value}' paper_data.json\"","aggregated_output":"MTEB\tMTEB: Massive Text Embedding Benchmark\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/MTEB.json\nTinyBenchmarks\ttinyBenchmarks: evaluating LLMs with fewer examples\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/TinyBenchmarks.json\nMetaBench\tmetabench -- A Sparse Benchmark of Reasoning and Knowledge in Large Language Models\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/MetaBench.json\nObservationalScaling\tObservational Scaling Laws and the Predictability of Langauge Model Performance\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/ObservationalScaling.json\nSloth\tSloth: scaling laws for LLM skills to predict multi-benchmark performance across families\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Sloth.json\nKoren2009\tMatrix Factorization Techniques for Recommender Systems\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Koren2009.json\nHu2008\tCollaborative Filtering for Implicit Feedback Datasets\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Hu2008.json\nCandes2009\tExact Matrix Completion via Convex Optimization\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Candes2009.json\nJain2013\tLow-rank Matrix Completion using Alternating Minimization\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Jain2013.json\nRennie2005\tFast maximum margin matrix factorization for collaborative prediction\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Rennie2005.json\nKoenker2001\tQuantile Regression\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Koenker2001.json\nStone1977\tConsistent Nonparametric Regression\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Stone1977.json\nBengio2004\tNo Unbiased Estimator of the Variance of K-Fold Cross-Validation\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Bengio2004.json\nHoerl1970\tRidge Regression: Biased Estimation for Nonorthogonal Problems\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Hoerl1970.json\nChaloner1995\tBayesian Experimental Design: A Review\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Chaloner1995.json\nCohn1996\tActive Learning with Statistical Models\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Cohn1996.json\nRubin1976\tInference and Missing Data\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Rubin1976.json\nEfron1979\tBootstrap Methods: Another Look at the Jackknife\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Efron1979.json\nCameron2008\tBootstrap-Based Improvements for Inference with Clustered Errors\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Cameron2008.json\nTakacs2008\tMatrix factorization and neighbor based algorithms for the netflix prize problem\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Takacs2008.json\nMnih2007\tProbabilistic Matrix Factorization\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Mnih2007.json\nSalakhutdinov2008\tBayesian probabilistic matrix factorization using Markov chain Monte Carlo\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Salakhutdinov2008.json\nCover1967\tNearest neighbor pattern classification\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Cover1967.json\nHarris2020\tArray programming with NumPy\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Harris2020.json\nHunter2007\tMatplotlib: A 2D Graphics Environment\tabstract\tliterature_evidence/Hunter2007.json\n7:    def __init__(self):\n12:    def __enter__(self):\n17:    def __exit__(self, *exception):\n20:    def get_output(self):\n{\n  \"key\": \"result.total_attempts\",\n  \"value\": {\n    \"id\": \"result.total_attempts\",\n    \"type\": \"count\",\n    \"value\": 3\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"key\": \"result.total_evaluated_programs\",\n  \"value\": {\n    \"id\": \"result.total_evaluated_programs\",\n    \"type\": \"count\",\n    \"value\": 2\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
